WEBVTT

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:07.700
Takao gave me a birthday present yesterday!

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.030
Takao has good fashion sense.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.820
A boy giving a girl an accessory is super high level.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.670
My sister told me that all the women around would start to chatter.

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:23.660
It'd be super embarrassing!

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.400
Wow, how cute!

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:33.010
Um, can you stop spreading things about boys that are embarrassing?

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.920
Takao, Thank you!

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:38.080
But I'm sorry you had to go through all that...

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.070
Don't worry about it.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:43.740
I wanted to see you happy, so that's why I did it.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:47.680
Yep! That's the expression.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:50.900
As long as you are happy!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.000
I'm so happy!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.200
You can have my Hanabi lips!

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.490
I never said anything like that!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.700
Stop it already!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:00.730
Shut up!

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.610
Hey, what did you give Takao in the end?

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:11.820
You went shopping with Tsutsumi, right?

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.330
I didn't buy anything.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.730
Why?

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.570
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:23.860
Tsutsumi told me yesterday that he wasn't my friend...

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:15.160
Tsutsumi was so kind before...

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.200
But why all of a sudden...

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.060
Did I do something wrong?

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.330
What should I do?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.730
What's going on?

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.830
Listen, listen!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.980
She's going to confess to Yamada!

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:30.310
Really!?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:35.660
Yes... But how should I do it?

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:40.670
The boys are always together, so it's hard to get time alone.

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:42.120
How about a letter?

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:46.520
But what if it gets passed around? That'd be the worst!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.310
You're right.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:52.200
Jeez, I've been worrying this entire time.

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.340
It's simple, my little kittens.

00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:00.490
If you don't have the chance to confess, then just create a confession event!

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:01.950
Event?

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.110
The marathon meet is coming up soon, right?

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:11.640
Just give the boys a special drink as your confession, how about that?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.510
I see!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.940
That's a great idea!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.240
So please help us, Hanabi.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.000
Eh? Me?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.370
That's right!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:24.100
Hanabi will give out the first drink and create a lovely atmosphere!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.960
Then everyone will know that you are handing out drinks to the one you love!

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.840
R-Really?

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.260
Do your best, Hanabi!

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.080
It's all up to you!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.960
Okay! I got it!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:38.430
Takao, what do you want to drink!?

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:41.900
Hanabi...

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.480
Create a confession event?

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.610
It's all up to me, they said!

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:50.440
I'll give you a drink and create a lovely atmosphere!

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:54.110
I don't really understand, but I'll be waiting for your drink.

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:56.690
Okay! I'll make sure it's delicious!

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:01.640
Out of my way.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.600
Sorry.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.500
Why is he angry?

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:14.940
He should at least tell me why...

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.900
You're still at it.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.740
Not really.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.270
If you like her, then don't hurt her.

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:40.060
All the girls have done a trial run, right?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.530
The real thing will be exactly the same, so make sure you remember.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.160
Okay!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:47.540
The boys are next.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.850
Go get ready!

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:51.820
Ayase.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:56.860
Tsutsumi just transferred here so he may not know the way too well.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.440
Can you teach him the course?

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:00.360
Okay!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.060
Tsutsumi, the course...

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.500
You're such an idiot, Tsutsumi.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:18.780
Hanabi, when the bell rings, give your drink to Takao.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:21.440
Then I'll confess, too.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.170
Okay!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.060
Hey, is Tsutsumi back yet?

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:27.720
No, not yet.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.600
Tsutsumi was in front of me,

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.850
but he entered this tiny alley. I guess he took a shortcut?

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.000
That's sly!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.960
So that means...

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.740
Don't tell me he got lost?

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:45.270
No way. I'm lost.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.690
How can a 6th grader get lost?

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.150
I'm so lame.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.120
Nothing good happens if she is involved.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:07.700
Tsutsumi! Are you okay?

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:12.380
Hanabi... Why?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.940
I didn't teach you the course properly.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.510
I'm sorry!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.320
Can you really be here?

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.800
Weren't you giving your drink to Takao?

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.300
You're right.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.680
I have to apologize when I get back.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.030
But...

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.780
Thank goodness I found you.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.680
Oh yeah, Tsutsumi.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:49.360
Even if you don't like me, you should at least tell me if it's something I did.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.360
I'm easily hurt...

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.030
I love you.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.300
But you gave me the cold shoulder all of a sudden...

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:02.160
I love you, so we can't stay as friends.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.220
I love you, so I didn't tell you the time.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:13.920
I love you, so that's why I didn't want you to go to Takao.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:19.440
I am going out with Takao...

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.030
I know!

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:25.090
Forget about that and give me a chance.

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.580
Tsutsumi...

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:33.040
I'm sorry. I haven't given up yet.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.680
Where did Hanabi go?

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.690
Hanabi!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:46.900
Where's Tsutsumi?

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.400
He's skipping class.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.020
Ayase, did something happen-

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:58.640
Hanabi, your hair is a mess! Let me fix it for you.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.600
Let's go home together today.

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:02.750
Okay.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:05.130
Tsutsumi and Ayase disappeared together.

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:07.010
Then the girls are having a hushed chat.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:11.740
That means something must have happened between Tsutsumi and Ayase!

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:12.550
Are you okay with that!?

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.640
Takao!

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:17.510
Ayase will get whisked away by Tsutsumi!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.890
What will you do!?

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:26.470
Hanabi, did Tsutsumi confess to you?

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.150
How did you know!?

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.590
Because we all knew that he likes you already.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.360
I never realized it.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:38.090
I thought he hated me.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.730
Flat chest! I don't plan on getting along with you.

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.600
Two or three fries is nothing.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.680
He's the Emperor, after all.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:52.870
I want to be his friend! But how should I tell him?

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:56.290
What's the right thing to say?

00:09:56.680 --> 00:10:00.100
I thought he wouldn't confess.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.040
He knows you're with Takao and that confessing will make you worried.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:09.110
But still, he confessed.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.520
That must have taken a lot of courage.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.480
Courage...

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:25.460
I need to reply to him properly!

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:26.560
Yep.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:38.180
What should I do? I don't know what I should say.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.650
But...

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.990
I need to think about what to say to Tsutsumi by myself!

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.030
You're so manly, Tsutsumi!

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.520
You accepted the challenge!

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:53.380
I knew you'd do it!

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.300
What's going on?

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.150
Hanabi, it's terrible!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.920
Ayase's here!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:00.180
Good for you!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:04.800
Tsutsumi and Takao are challenging each other during the marathon for you!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:05.620
Eh?

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.380
Isn't that right, Tsutsumi?

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:08.780
I don't care either way.

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:12.670
Don't just decide that by yourselves!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:14.460
He won't agree to this!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.720
Right, Takao?

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.350
This is madness.

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:23.420
But if that will make Tsutsumi give up...

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.200
I accept.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.600
Takao...

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.660
Since I'm in, I'm in it to win.

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:36.360
Tsutsumi vs Takao!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:40.620
Things are heating up!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.100
Duel of the handsome guys!

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.420
Quite a duel!

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.680
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.930
Things have gotten terrible!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:03.460
Takao and Tsutsumi are going at it during the marathon meet!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.120
I can't believe it! They're betting on me!?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:06.880
What's going on?

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.040
If Tsutsumi wins, then I have to go out with him?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.840
Eh!?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.640
What should I do?

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.270
Takao!

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:22.640
Sorry about that.

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.830
Why did you accept the challenge?

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:30.230
That guy won't give up otherwise.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.420
A challenge for Hanabi...

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:38.300
That just makes her worried.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:41.290
She just has to sit tight and wait.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.950
But what if Takao loses?

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:44.880
He won't lose.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:50.390
If he truly loves the girl, then he won't ever lose.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:00.750
I'll win.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.780
I understand what Takao is saying.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.750
I won't give up even if you rejected me!

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:13.440
I don't want to be only friends!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:16.520
I'll still see you, Yamada!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.320
The girls who have gotten dumped...

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:24.330
Tsutsumi decided to challenge Takao because he wanted to put an end to this.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:29.120
That's why Takao accepted it.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.970
Really?

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:32.870
So?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.040
So what?

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:38.160
What if Takao wins? Will you give him a kiss?

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:38.970
K-

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:41.350
Kiss?

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:44.120
"This win is for your lips."

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:46.560
I want someone to say that to me!

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.830
K-Kiss...

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:52.410
Just say, "Here's your reward." and go for it.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.330
Practicing for the marathon?

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.360
Who are you?

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:16.240
How mean! I, Cocoa, have been worried about you!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.020
Huh?

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:23.130
Hanabi happily said that she'll kiss Takao if he wins.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.180
Something about a reward.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.130
Tsutsumi, you poor thing.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:38.020
Do you want my help to win?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:50.850
Seems like the girls' marathon is over!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.700
Next up are the boys!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.520
Your participants are...

00:14:56.060 --> 00:15:00.510
"We already kissed so keep your hands off of her!" Mr. Takao!

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:05.040
Mr. Tsutsumi who grew up in Tokyo!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.960
This fated challenge is for Ayase's hand!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:08.910
We will give you the best commentary!

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:11.090
You three need to run, too!

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.210
Hanabi.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.400
Watch me.

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:20.560
Takao... You'll win, right?

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.500
Ready... Start!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:37.410
He's fast, as I expected.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:40.600
But I won't lose!

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.830
Live update!

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.130
Takao is first right now!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.000
That's great, Hanabi.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:52.620
Huh? Where did Cocoa go?

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:55.250
Oh yeah, she's not here.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.680
Takao...

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:03.140
Takao.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.360
Hamana.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.380
Why are you here?

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.010
The girls should be finished already.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:14.760
My stomach hurts and I can't move.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.930
Help me, Takao!

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.450
Takao, what are you doing?

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:22.970
She can't move, she says.

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.770
That's why I'll carry her back.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:28.650
Huh? Are you looking down at me?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.980
How can you beat me then?

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.620
This is for Hanabi!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:38.200
But I can't leave her behind.

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:43.460
Do whatever you want!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.540
Of course she's faking it!

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.380
Are you an idiot!?

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:52.620
Someone like you who puts up a nice face for everyone...

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:54.640
I won't hand Hanabi over to someone like that!

00:16:57.350 --> 00:16:59.480
First place is back!

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:02.280
Huh? Where's Takao?

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.320
Are you serious?

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.310
Hanabi!?

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:10.900
Hey! Where are you going?

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:12.780
Something happened to Takao, right?

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:15.610
What do you mean?

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.400
Because he said he'd win!

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.420
Maybe he just gave up!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.360
He won't do anything like that!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.340
Come with me, Hanabi!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.220
Get on my back.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:39.270
It hurts so much! I can't move!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:42.680
Takao, stay by my side.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:47.530
Takao!

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:50.470
Ayase! Tsutsumi!

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:53.440
Are you okay? Did something happen?

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.490
No, I'm fine.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:59.460
Hamana said that her stomach hurts and that she can't move.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.800
Cocoa, don't tell me...

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.380
Your period?

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.260
Huh!? No!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.580
I'm sorry! I said that too loud!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:14.520
I'm not on my period! I was faking it!

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.150
Faking it?

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.880
This girl came to me yesterday to see if I want to pull a fast one on Takao.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:26.730
You knew I was faking it and ran to the goal!

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:28.040
You're my partner in crime!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.030
I haven't reached the goal yet.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:33.670
Huh!? What are you doing!?

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:37.400
I gave you this sweet chance to steal Hanabi!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:40.500
Are you trying to act cool? Are you an idiot?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.510
Who's the idiot here?

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.880
Tsutsumi told me his feelings properly!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:55.790
He didn't play any tricks and challenged Takao to a fair fight!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:02.060
I won't forgive you for insulting my precious friends!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:07.640
Hmph. You can say whatever you want.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:14.220
Takao gave up his fight for you to help me.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:17.600
He wants to be by my side forever, right?

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:19.310
Yeah...

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:26.200
...Because that's what Ayase would have done.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:30.230
I'm sure no matter who is down, she'll reach out her hand to help.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.990
I felt I must do that, too.

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:37.820
If I'm to be by her side.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.820
Takao...

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:45.580
What's with you two?

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.620
You trust each other completely.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:52.460
Takao, we can start this fight over...

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:56.410
Hey, wait! That's not fair!

00:19:56.410 --> 00:20:00.050
Tsutsumi, thank you for not reaching the goal yet.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:04.170
If you hadn't fallen for Ayase, then we might have become friends.

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:07.640
Hmph, in your dreams.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:22.870
What? Takao wins in the end? Tch!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.040
Tsutsumi.

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:28.700
What?

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:32.220
Thank you for confessing to me.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.700
I was really happy.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:41.880
I like you too, but it's different from Takao.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:48.600
That's why I hope we can be friends from now on!

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.150
Tsutsumi?

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.170
I don't think I can for a while.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:06.100
But maybe when I've matured for a bit and if that's what you really want...

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:09.210
Even if I can't be your boyfriend...

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:13.360
Friend? You mean you'll be my friend?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.570
Thank you!

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:21.200
Oh my, boyfriend means your lover.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:23.180
I wonder if Hanabi understood?

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:23.860
Eh?

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.660
Takao has his hands full.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.010
Takao.

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:33.540
Ayase, I won. Is there a reward for me?

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:36.010
Um...

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:50.010
Why are you laughing?

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:51.880
I'm sorry, you're just too cute.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:56.080
But that's not the reward I want.

00:21:57.850 --> 00:21:59.250
Maybe next time.

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:08.940
Age 12... The "next time" is another story.

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:43.660
You don't want me to smile at you, Hiyama?

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:45.370
My smile makes you mad?

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:48.220
Why are you being so difficult?

00:23:48.220 --> 00:23:51.450
Huh? You've been watching me?

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:53.070
From that long ago?

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:56.370
Let's make everyone's hearts throb next time.
